tasks.description:
Create two .NET 10 console projects. Runner/Runner.csproj must reference QaaS.Runner Version=4.5.1 and QaaS.Common.Assertions Version=3.5.1; add ItemGroup with None Update='*.qaas.yaml' CopyToOutputDirectory=Always and None Update='TestData/*' CopyToOutputDirectory=Always. Runner/Program.cs must contain exactly one line: QaaS.Runner.Bootstrap.New(args).Run();

Mocker/Mocker.csproj must reference QaaS.Mocker Version=2.4.1 and QaaS.Common.Processors Version=1.5.1; add ItemGroup with None Update='*.mocker.yaml' CopyToOutputDirectory=Always. Mocker/Program.cs must contain exactly one line: QaaS.Mocker.Bootstrap.New(args).Run();

Both projects: OutputType Exe, TargetFramework net10.0, ImplicitUsings enable, Nullable enable. Do NOT add QaaS.Common.Probes to this project — no topology probes are needed because relay.ps1 declares both exchanges at startup. Do NOT reference non-existent packages. Version 4.5.1 is the correct QaaS.Runner version; putting 4.5.1 on QaaS.Common.* packages is wrong and will cause NU1102 (FB s13#9).
